diff --git a/changelog/13564.improvement.rst b/changelog/13564.improvement.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..af8346eef17
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/13564.improvement.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Issue a warning when fixtures are wrapped with a decorator that prevents
+correct discovery, including ``@classmethod`` above ``@pytest.fixture`` and
+``@staticmethod`` above ``@pytest.fixture``. Put ``@pytest.fixture`` above
+those decorators on test classes.
